{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着歐洲國家和企業重新評估對美國科技供應商的依賴程度，歐洲本土網絡安全廠商正在獲得越來越多市場份額。最新數據顯示，在關税爭端、跨大西洋關係趨緊以及數據主權擔憂加劇的背景下，歐洲網絡安全企業的增長速度已經超過美國競爭對手。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586308.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:45:31.613556+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T17:20:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_hash":"084a1682a00a76e4ef5a8eb8f9963e01885f1b00e3495e28dbbe3b0ca85bc818","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}